[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2607810373","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101909#issuecomment-2607810373","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101909","id":2607810373,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bcAdF","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-22T17:12:34Z","updated_at":"2025-01-22T17:31:35Z","body":"WebGL uses the [`EXT_texture_compression_rgtc`](https://registry.khronos.org/webgl/extensions/EXT_texture_compression_rgtc/) extension to support RGTC, which only supports 2D images (not 3D images which include array textures). \r\n\r\nCompare that to the [`WEBGL_compressed_texture`](https://registry.khronos.org/webgl/extensions/WEBGL_compressed_texture_etc/) extension (for ETC) which specifically mentions array textures. \r\n\r\n~Implementations are required to support either ETC or S3TC/RGTC, but the wording of _both_ the RGTC and S3TC extensions don't cover array textures. Therefore they are not required to be supported for RGTC or S3TC.~\r\n\r\n~Have you checked whether S3TC array textures are supported on your device? I wonder if there is another optional extension that adds support that we could check for.~ The extension for S3TC mandates support for 3D textures [`EXT_texture_compression_s3tc`](https://registry.khronos.org/OpenGL/extensions/EXT/EXT_texture_compression_s3tc.txt). So there is nothing to worry about\r\n\r\n_Edit: The plot thickens. The RGTC extension says that it is basically just [`EXT_texture_compression_rgtc`](https://registry.khronos.org/OpenGL/extensions/EXT/EXT_texture_compression_rgtc.txt) which specifically says that it errors with 1D or 3D texture types (this is true on any mobile device as well). The extensions for BPTC and ASTC have similar wording (in the sense that they only mention 2D variants, but refer to a different extension for more details). But in both cases the extension they refer to specifically includes 3D textures and/or texture arrays_","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2607810373/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2607841226","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101909#issuecomment-2607841226","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101909","id":2607841226,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bcH_K","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-22T17:26:44Z","updated_at":"2025-01-22T17:32:32Z","body":"On an unrelated note, it would be interesting to look into properly supporting ASTC in the web. I think all we need to do is check for [`WEBGL_compressed_texture_astc`](https://registry.khronos.org/webgl/extensions/WEBGL_compressed_texture_astc/) and then it should work just like BPTC. Also it seems very [widely support](https://caniuse.com/mdn-api_webgl_compressed_texture_astc) so for web exports we may want to always use ASTC when available","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2607841226/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2608129224","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101909#issuecomment-2608129224","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101909","id":2608129224,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bdOTI","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-22T19:48:57Z","updated_at":"2025-01-22T19:48:57Z","body":"> On an unrelated note, it would be interesting to look into properly supporting ASTC in the web. I think all we need to do is check for [`WEBGL_compressed_texture_astc`](https://registry.khronos.org/webgl/extensions/WEBGL_compressed_texture_astc/) and then it should work just like BPTC. Also it seems very [widely support](https://caniuse.com/mdn-api_webgl_compressed_texture_astc) so for web exports we may want to always use ASTC when available\r\n\r\nAdded in #101932","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2608129224/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2612763565","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101909#issuecomment-2612763565","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101909","id":2612763565,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bu5ut","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-24T15:11:43Z","updated_at":"2025-01-24T15:11:43Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2612763565/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]